WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:20.020
Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa

00:20.020 --> 00:23.620
Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai

00:52.750 --> 01:00.020
Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu

01:00.020 --> 01:03.690
Nani o mitsukete yukou

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
Kokoro o hakidashite

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
Nani o mitsumete iyou

01:18.210 --> 01:24.980
Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o

01:24.980 --> 01:28.710
Let it go, shinjiyou

01:48.000 --> 01:49.470
I'm stuffed!

01:52.310 --> 01:55.740
It's been so long since we last
had a proper meal.

01:56.610 --> 01:58.940
It was lightly flavored but not bad.

01:59.710 --> 02:02.920
Hey, Sanzo, what are we
going to do now?

02:02.920 --> 02:05.720
We'll find lodgings in
this town for tonight.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.690
We'll depart tomorrow morning.

02:07.690 --> 02:10.030
Then, we have to look for an inn first.

02:10.030 --> 02:14.800
No need for that. I believe there was
an inn behind this restaurant.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.560
Well, if that's the case...

02:17.530 --> 02:19.020
What's up, Gojyo?

02:19.670 --> 02:22.870
We depart tomorrow, and
we've picked an inn.

02:22.870 --> 02:25.210
Then there's only one thing to do.

02:25.210 --> 02:27.040
Eat a meal.

02:27.040 --> 02:28.510
Fool!

02:29.480 --> 02:34.250
Damn moronic monkey! I ain't you!

02:34.250 --> 02:36.120
Then what're you going to do?!

02:36.120 --> 02:37.580
What else?

02:38.550 --> 02:41.350
Cruise for chicks.
Cruise - For - Chicks.

02:53.500 --> 02:55.000
You're just letting him go?

02:55.000 --> 02:57.370
Leave it, and good riddance.

02:57.370 --> 03:01.780
Hey, Hakkai, let's go
out too and shop!

03:01.780 --> 03:06.780
Sounds good. After all, there are
a lot of supplies we need to get.

03:06.780 --> 03:08.250
All right!

03:09.120 --> 03:12.450
I'm getting low on cigarettes,
so buy some for me.

03:12.450 --> 03:13.960
Also,

03:13.960 --> 03:16.730
this may be the Sanbutsushin's
ATM card,

03:16.730 --> 03:20.000
but don't spoil Goku by buying food
and feeding it to him.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.460
You cheapskate!

03:23.130 --> 03:27.120
Having said that, I can't be seen
walking with just any girl.

03:29.140 --> 03:31.940
Hey, that neatly dressed
girl looks nice.

03:33.170 --> 03:36.010
But those are the type who'll
follow me around forever,

03:36.010 --> 03:39.050
after spending just
one night together.

03:39.050 --> 03:41.280
Hey, she's nice too.

03:41.280 --> 03:45.650
She's a bit young, but that
casual attitude is nice.

03:45.650 --> 03:48.390
But those kinds of girls
cost a lot of money.

03:48.390 --> 03:50.060
She'll make me pay for this and that,

03:50.060 --> 03:53.080
and they're always the ones
who are really high-handed.

03:54.830 --> 03:57.530
What the hell is that?!

03:57.530 --> 03:59.730
Do they actually think they look cute?!

03:59.730 --> 04:02.470
It would suck to have girls
like that after you.

04:02.470 --> 04:05.630
And if you dumped one, I bet you'd
have a whole lot of other problems.

04:07.610 --> 04:09.370
I wish I hadn't thought about it.

04:11.480 --> 04:12.710
Oh, sorry, man.

04:12.710 --> 04:12.980
Hey, hold it right there.
Oh, sorry, man.

04:12.980 --> 04:14.180
Hey, hold it right there.

04:17.520 --> 04:18.990
A fight! A fight!

04:20.720 --> 04:23.190
A thin guy's getting picked on
by a big guy!

04:26.330 --> 04:27.800
Man, that hurt!

04:28.560 --> 04:32.660
My arm bone just might be
broken, right, Bro?

04:34.970 --> 04:36.940
Your way of picking a fight
has no style.

04:38.270 --> 04:41.570
Maybe you should put more
of a twist on it, Mister.

04:42.680 --> 04:45.880
You've got guts. I'll let you get
away with your life for that.

04:45.880 --> 04:50.620
That is, IF you leave behind all
the money you got on you.

04:50.620 --> 04:52.850
Quit your big talk and
come and get me.

04:54.260 --> 04:57.250
I'm in a hurry, you moron!

05:00.630 --> 05:04.330
Damn you, don't you dare
make fun of me!

05:04.330 --> 05:06.490
A moron is a moron!

05:11.040 --> 05:15.810
Sorry, but I've got no time
to waste on guys.

05:29.490 --> 05:30.960
What the heck?

05:33.360 --> 05:35.130
Mister!

05:35.130 --> 05:36.600
Mist... Mister!

05:38.900 --> 05:40.140
Sha Gojyo, age 22

05:40.140 --> 05:41.300
Sha Gojyo, age 22 (single)

05:45.470 --> 05:47.780
Listen here, missy.

05:47.780 --> 05:52.010
I'll have you know, I'm a big
brother, not a mister.

05:52.010 --> 05:53.710
Okay?

05:54.880 --> 05:58.220
All right, if you understand,
then that's fine.

05:58.220 --> 05:58.950
Later!

05:58.950 --> 05:59.720
Oh, wait a minute, Mister!
Later!

05:59.720 --> 06:01.520
Oh, wait a minute, Mister!

06:03.090 --> 06:04.680
Like I said...

06:05.630 --> 06:07.090
Big Brother, right?

06:28.480 --> 06:30.490
Damn it, what's the big idea?

06:30.490 --> 06:32.590
First a moron and now a lost kid?

06:32.590 --> 06:34.650
Are my fortunes for today that bad?

06:35.720 --> 06:37.990
Please! Quit following me!

06:37.990 --> 06:42.190
No! I'm going to follow you until
you hear what I have to say!

06:45.800 --> 06:47.270
Hey, he ran!

06:47.840 --> 06:49.340
This isn't funny!

06:49.340 --> 06:52.040
I can't cruise for chicks
with a kid around!

06:52.040 --> 06:53.510
Wait!

06:54.140 --> 06:55.610
Wait!

06:56.540 --> 06:58.710
I said, wait!

06:58.710 --> 07:00.350
Damn it!

07:00.350 --> 07:01.880
Over here?!

07:01.880 --> 07:03.650
Quit following me!

07:03.650 --> 07:05.310
All right, over here?! Wait!

07:07.060 --> 07:08.490
I said, wait!

07:11.130 --> 07:12.590
Wait!

07:16.830 --> 07:18.300
Looks like I finally lost her.

07:23.400 --> 07:24.870
Hi-Hi!

07:28.580 --> 07:30.150
Say, missy...

07:30.150 --> 07:32.580
I'm not a missy. My name's Meihou.

07:33.520 --> 07:36.710
All right, Meihou, I'm begging you,
go away someplace.

07:37.390 --> 07:42.520
Mister... No! Big Brother has some
important business to attend to.

07:42.520 --> 07:43.760
What business?

07:43.760 --> 07:44.030
I gotta get together with a pretty chick
and have dinner with her.
What business?

07:44.030 --> 07:48.930
I gotta get together with a pretty chick
and have dinner with her.

07:48.930 --> 07:50.170
So...

07:50.170 --> 07:50.430
So...
Is that a date?

07:50.430 --> 07:51.630
Is that a date?

07:53.130 --> 07:55.160
Well, I guess you could call it that.

07:57.370 --> 07:59.840
Then I'll go on a date with you!

08:01.440 --> 08:03.470
When you're a little older, okay?

08:08.750 --> 08:10.220
That's Gojyo...

08:15.420 --> 08:18.260
What's the matter, stopping in the
middle of the road so suddenly?

08:18.260 --> 08:23.060
Gojyo's duping a little girl because
he can't pick up chicks!

08:23.060 --> 08:24.530
Gojyo is?

08:26.730 --> 08:27.740
Where?

08:27.740 --> 08:28.240
What?
Where?

08:28.240 --> 08:29.240
What?
Perhaps you mistook him
for someone else?

08:29.240 --> 08:30.440
Perhaps you mistook him
for someone else?

08:30.440 --> 08:36.510
No way! Gojyo was with
a girl this little!

08:36.510 --> 08:38.580
That isn't possible.

08:38.580 --> 08:41.920
Gojyo may not look it,
but he's actually normal.

08:41.920 --> 08:43.610
Are you sure?

08:47.690 --> 08:49.160
Thank you for the food!

08:50.630 --> 08:54.430
Here's the deal. You go straight home
when you're done eating that.

08:54.430 --> 08:56.190
No! I won't eat it then!

08:57.300 --> 08:58.770
Hey, now...

09:04.740 --> 09:07.210
Oh, all right.

09:07.210 --> 09:08.680
Just eat that.

09:16.950 --> 09:18.380
Say, Mister?

09:20.190 --> 09:21.750
What's your name?

09:22.390 --> 09:27.260
Me? My name's Gojyo,

09:27.260 --> 09:28.730
Sha Gojyo.

09:33.170 --> 09:34.660
Weird name.

09:39.110 --> 09:40.570
Say, Gojyo?

09:44.010 --> 09:45.500
Please listen to what I have to say.

09:53.890 --> 09:55.360
Oh, fine.

09:56.290 --> 09:57.760
Then...

09:58.560 --> 10:00.720
Go ahead, talk.

10:02.930 --> 10:04.500
I...

10:04.500 --> 10:07.090
I want to hire you!

10:14.040 --> 10:16.480
I want to hire you!

10:19.210 --> 10:23.220
What're you talking about? Do you
even know what hiring means?

10:23.220 --> 10:25.280
Gojyo, you're strong, right?

10:25.950 --> 10:28.990
I'm pretty strong, if I do
say so myself.

10:28.990 --> 10:31.020
That's why I want to hire you.

10:31.890 --> 10:33.360
Hire?

10:34.860 --> 10:37.190
I'll have you know, I'm expensive.

10:39.400 --> 10:43.300
All right, I don't have money,

10:43.300 --> 10:44.970
so please take this.

10:44.970 --> 10:46.470
What the heck is this?

10:46.470 --> 10:47.940
This is just a...

10:52.850 --> 10:54.440
I guess you've got your reasons.

10:59.590 --> 11:01.020
Say, Mother?

11:02.160 --> 11:05.420
How much longer until we reach
a town without demons?

11:06.230 --> 11:11.390
Well, if you're a good girl, I'm sure
we'll get there really soon.

11:11.930 --> 11:14.700
That's right, Meihou.
So, go to sleep now.

11:29.650 --> 11:32.950
Understand? Don't ever
come out of there.

11:32.950 --> 11:34.520
But...

11:34.520 --> 11:36.220
Don't make any noise.

11:36.220 --> 11:38.190
In the morning, head into town.

11:38.690 --> 11:40.190
Mother!

11:40.190 --> 11:41.300
Take care.

11:41.300 --> 11:41.700
Mother!
Take care.

11:41.700 --> 11:42.750
Mother!

11:43.930 --> 11:45.400
Mother!

12:02.780 --> 12:06.520
I told the townspeople, but
no one would listen to me.

12:06.520 --> 12:09.960
I don't know if they didn't believe me
because I'm a kid,

12:09.960 --> 12:12.080
or because they're afraid
of the demons.

12:12.690 --> 12:16.090
I see, no wonder you were
so persistent.

12:16.930 --> 12:19.370
Then shall we get going?

12:19.370 --> 12:21.770
We're going to give them the
revenge smack-down, right?

12:25.370 --> 12:26.710
We're back.

12:26.710 --> 12:26.870
Hey, Gojyo still isn't back after all.
We're back.

12:26.870 --> 12:29.310
Hey, Gojyo still isn't back after all.

12:29.310 --> 12:31.110
Please forgive us for being so late.

12:31.110 --> 12:33.610
Goku kept on wanting this and that,

12:33.610 --> 12:35.850
so we ended up doing a
little wasteful spending.

12:35.850 --> 12:38.380
Do what you want. It's not
my money anyway.

12:41.760 --> 12:43.660
More importantly, how's
the town seem?

12:43.660 --> 12:47.200
It's a peaceful town,
very lively too, but...

12:47.200 --> 12:48.300
But?

12:48.300 --> 12:51.330
I heard a slightly disturbing rumor.

12:51.330 --> 12:53.030
What kind of rumor?

12:53.030 --> 12:57.240
It seems some demons have
taken up residence

12:57.240 --> 12:59.870
in the forest just a little west of town.

12:59.870 --> 13:02.840
The townspeople are saying
people get spirited away,

13:02.840 --> 13:05.250
but it's almost certainly
the work of demons.

13:05.250 --> 13:09.420
It seems people are disappearing
frequently these days.

13:09.420 --> 13:13.390
Me, me! I saw something
disturbing too!

13:13.390 --> 13:17.950
Gojyo was on a date with
a girl this tiny!

13:19.290 --> 13:20.900
Shut up.

13:20.900 --> 13:24.130
Sheesh, this is why grownups
are just so...

13:24.130 --> 13:25.470
What shall we do?

13:25.470 --> 13:28.700
Either way, that forest
is directly in our path.

13:28.700 --> 13:30.570
Let's check it out a little.

13:30.570 --> 13:34.840
Then I guess we should go ask
around town a bit more.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.310
Yeah...

13:38.250 --> 13:40.050
This is the forest.

13:40.050 --> 13:42.680
The townspeople call it the forest
of the spirited-away,

13:42.680 --> 13:44.210
and no one will come near it.

13:45.450 --> 13:49.290
Spirits and demons... Well, I guess
they're not much different.

13:50.530 --> 13:51.990
Gojyo...

13:52.560 --> 13:54.190
So this is where you were attacked.

13:56.500 --> 13:58.470
It's pretty close...

13:59.530 --> 14:01.040
No, just talking to myself.

14:01.040 --> 14:02.540
Come on, let's go.

14:02.540 --> 14:05.170
Go? Where?

14:05.170 --> 14:07.440
The demon hideout.

14:13.350 --> 14:16.320
You ready, princess?

14:16.320 --> 14:17.840
Yeah, I'm ready.

14:19.090 --> 14:20.580
Hello there!

14:22.120 --> 14:23.590
There doesn't seem to be anyone here.

14:29.600 --> 14:31.230
What's the matter?

14:31.230 --> 14:33.070
Something's not right here.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.530
Something? Like what?

14:35.770 --> 14:38.470
At first glance, it seems like a
completely ordinary house,

14:38.470 --> 14:40.410
but something just doesn't feel right.

14:40.410 --> 14:43.040
I feel like we've been thrown into
a miniature dollhouse.

14:43.580 --> 14:45.050
And this demonic aura...

14:45.610 --> 14:47.420
It's reverberating throughout
the house,

14:47.420 --> 14:49.880
so I don't have a clue where
he's actually located.

14:52.120 --> 14:54.110
Gojyo, over there.

14:55.420 --> 14:56.890
Beyond the door?

14:59.260 --> 15:01.600
What the hell is this?!

15:01.600 --> 15:03.030
No!

15:08.740 --> 15:09.440
Everyone!

15:09.440 --> 15:10.140
Wait!
Everyone!

15:10.140 --> 15:10.940
Wait!
Let me go!

15:10.940 --> 15:11.610
Calm down, stupid!
Let me go!

15:11.610 --> 15:12.870
Calm down, stupid!

15:12.870 --> 15:14.570
Take a look at this!

15:21.520 --> 15:25.020
We're in the whale's stomach
as it were.

15:25.020 --> 15:27.150
Let's get outside first. Got it?

15:32.130 --> 15:33.860
So it always comes down to this.

15:33.860 --> 15:35.560
Let's run!

15:35.560 --> 15:37.030
No!

15:38.130 --> 15:39.600
Hurry!

15:40.800 --> 15:42.270
Take that!

15:45.070 --> 15:46.540
Jump, Meihou!

15:51.550 --> 15:54.250
No one likes a persistent guy!

15:54.250 --> 15:55.820
Gojyo!

15:55.820 --> 15:57.390
The exit!

15:57.390 --> 15:58.850
Damn!

16:01.920 --> 16:03.390
Gojyo, hurry!

16:04.060 --> 16:06.250
No, I don't think that's gonna happen.

16:08.360 --> 16:09.130
Gojyo!

16:09.130 --> 16:09.860
Stay back! You're in the way,
so hurry up and go!
Gojyo!

16:09.860 --> 16:12.270
Stay back! You're in the way,
so hurry up and go!

16:12.270 --> 16:14.700
But you're... You're...

16:17.670 --> 16:20.440
I've always had a soft spot for women.

16:21.680 --> 16:24.300
No! Gojyo!

16:26.050 --> 16:27.650
That cry!

16:27.650 --> 16:29.380
They ARE together!

16:35.820 --> 16:37.560
What a surprise.

16:37.560 --> 16:40.860
I never thought anyone would come
on their own just to be eaten.

16:41.660 --> 16:44.690
Don't you think your hospitality
could use a little work?

16:45.430 --> 16:49.400
So, you can still talk back?
You've got some nerve.

16:49.400 --> 16:51.840
I've always had a glib tongue.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.870
Just who the hell are you?

16:53.870 --> 16:55.210
Does it matter?

16:55.210 --> 16:58.380
Fine, you're going to die anyway.

16:58.380 --> 17:00.720
Since I'm going to die anyway,
mind if I ask you something?

17:00.720 --> 17:03.350
Are those people back
there still alive?

17:03.350 --> 17:06.450
Yeah, food's always better
when it's fresh.

17:06.450 --> 17:08.720
Oh, is that so? That's good to know.

17:08.720 --> 17:12.590
But I'm going to kill you right away.

17:12.590 --> 17:15.960
Ooh, scary. And why is that?

17:15.960 --> 17:18.960
Because you smell dangerous!

17:23.600 --> 17:27.040
Well, well, what perfect timing.

17:27.040 --> 17:29.910
You look good up there, Gojyo.

17:29.910 --> 17:32.850
Yeah, yeah, I know.

17:32.850 --> 17:34.850
Shall we take a photograph?

17:34.850 --> 17:36.980
Oh, anything but that.

17:36.980 --> 17:38.880
Don't be shy, Gojyo.

17:43.190 --> 17:45.180
When in the world did you...

17:48.460 --> 17:49.930
What?!

17:53.300 --> 17:55.270
Be careful, Goku!

17:55.270 --> 17:56.670
Thank you!

17:56.670 --> 17:58.160
Damn it, there's no end!

18:00.240 --> 18:02.230
Hakkai, isn't there something
we can do?!

18:02.910 --> 18:04.570
Easy for you to say...

18:09.280 --> 18:11.550
How about aiming at that?

18:11.550 --> 18:13.850
It sort of looks like a weakness,
you know?

18:13.850 --> 18:16.160
You sure that's good enough?

18:16.160 --> 18:19.130
Let's bet on Hakkai's intuition,
shall we?

18:19.130 --> 18:21.760
He's a gambler after all.

18:21.760 --> 18:23.500
Here we go!

18:23.500 --> 18:24.960
Oh, no, you're not!

18:27.640 --> 18:29.600
And now, you're unarmed.

18:31.410 --> 18:32.940
Too bad.

18:32.940 --> 18:36.670
I'm stronger when I'm unarmed!

18:39.350 --> 18:40.810
Take that!

19:02.740 --> 19:05.030
Mother! Father!

19:08.640 --> 19:10.910
Mother!

19:11.380 --> 19:12.480
Meihou!

19:12.480 --> 19:12.880
Thank goodness! Oh, thank goodness!
Meihou!

19:12.880 --> 19:15.110
Thank goodness! Oh, thank goodness!

19:20.220 --> 19:21.710
Gojyo!

19:23.460 --> 19:25.960
I'm happy for you, Meihou.

19:25.960 --> 19:27.430
Gojyo...

19:29.930 --> 19:32.030
See ya. Oh, wait.

19:32.030 --> 19:34.800
It won't look good on me anyway.

19:34.800 --> 19:38.240
But then I haven't done
anything in return!

19:41.080 --> 19:43.480
I'll come back again in ten years.

19:43.480 --> 19:46.610
Let's make that pendant a way
for me to find you then.

19:47.650 --> 19:50.410
I'll sweet-talk you good
and proper then.

19:51.820 --> 19:54.690
Okay! Gojyo, thank you!

20:01.330 --> 20:02.800
Ten years from now?

20:04.400 --> 20:08.600
Incidentally, how did you show up
so conveniently?

20:09.540 --> 20:12.440
We wanted to see your girlfriend.

20:13.110 --> 20:15.610
We heard the rumors in town.

20:15.610 --> 20:18.650
That someone fitting your description
rampaged through town,

20:18.650 --> 20:22.120
then ran off into the woods
with a little girl.

20:22.120 --> 20:26.390
That girl was pretty cute. Gojyo,
I never knew you had such tastes.

20:26.390 --> 20:28.520
You wanna die, monkey?!

20:28.520 --> 20:31.090
What? It's the truth, isn't it?
You cradle-robbing water sprite.

20:31.090 --> 20:32.560
What'd you call me?!

20:33.490 --> 20:35.260
You're dead meat.

20:35.860 --> 20:38.960
Shut up! Or I'll kill you both!

20:43.670 --> 20:50.080
Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru

20:50.080 --> 20:55.450
Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku

20:55.450 --> 21:00.960
Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de

21:00.960 --> 21:04.360
Ue o miagerunda

21:04.360 --> 21:10.160
Donna arifureta shiin mo enji-tsuzukeru

21:10.160 --> 21:15.570
Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa

21:15.570 --> 21:20.910
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

21:20.910 --> 21:24.840
You must fight against yourself

21:31.850 --> 21:35.490
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:35.490 --> 21:37.460
Repeating is one change

21:37.460 --> 21:41.600
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:41.600 --> 21:45.700
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:45.700 --> 21:48.400
Go forward now

21:48.400 --> 21:53.440
Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de

21:53.440 --> 21:58.850
Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau

21:58.850 --> 22:04.280
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

22:04.280 --> 22:08.310
You must fight against yourself

22:18.230 --> 22:19.630
Next Saiyuki

22:21.470 --> 22:23.340
In the steady rain,

22:23.340 --> 22:26.370
these companions came together,
each with their own scars.

22:26.370 --> 22:28.280
The pursuer and the pursued.

22:28.280 --> 22:33.080
That was when the wheels of fate
began to quietly turn.

22:33.080 --> 22:36.310
No one knows yet what
the future holds.

22:37.550 --> 22:37.750
Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki,
"The Binding Spell of Crimson"

22:37.750 --> 22:41.620
Next Time
The Binding Spell of Crimson
Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki,
"The Binding Spell of Crimson"

22:41.620 --> 22:43.150
You'd do well to watch!
